{"id":"15263766","articleId":"13364459","title":"Holding Rewards","description":"Earn rewards on eligible positions while helping maintain long-term market pricing accuracy","blocks":[{"type":"subheading","text":"<b>What are we doing?</b>","idAttribute":"h_a990d02722"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"To keep long-term pricing accurate, we’re paying 3.25% annualized Holding Reward based on your total position value in certain Polymarkets. We anticipate rolling out a new reward and oracle-resolution system later this year — at which point there will be a simple 1-click migration.","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" ","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"subheading","text":"<b>​Reward Rate and Conditions</b>","idAttribute":"h_eb943299bf"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"The current rate is set at 3.25% and applies to all eligible positions. This rate is variable and subject to change at Polymarket’s discretion. We also reserve the right to introduce limits to the total amount of rewards paid out at any time. This iteration of rewards is funded through the Polymarket Treasury.","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" ","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Your total position value is randomly sampled once each hour, and the reward is distributed daily. Your rewards are calculated based on the total position value of your eligible positions at the time of evaluation.","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" ","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"subheading","text":"<b>​Total Position Value Computation</b>","idAttribute":"h_78f85c52db"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"For each eligible polymarket, we calculate the eligible position in the following way:","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" ","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"<b>Position Valuation</b>:","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"unorderedNestedList","text":"- Based on your current “Yes” and “No” shares and the most recent mid-price for each outcome.","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Based on your current “Yes” and “No” shares and the most recent mid-price for each outcome.","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"type":"subheading","text":"<b>​Example</b>","idAttribute":"h_7bd3ef5532"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"If you hold at the time of sampling:","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"unorderedNestedList","text":"- 30,000 “Yes” shares at a price of <b>$0.53</b>\n- 10,000 “No” shares at a price of <b>$0.45</b>","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"30,000 “Yes” shares at a price of <b>$0.53</b>","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"10,000 “No” shares at a price of <b>$0.45</b>","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","text":"<b>Total Position Value</b>:","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"unorderedNestedList","text":"- <b><code>(30000 × 0.53) + (10000 × 0.45)</code></b>\n- <b><code>$15,900 + $4,500 = $20,400</code></b>","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"<b><code>(30000 × 0.53) + (10000 × 0.45)</code></b>","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"<b><code>$15,900 + $4,500 = $20,400</code></b>","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","text":"<b>Hourly Holding Reward Calculation </b>(based on 3.25% Annual Reward):","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"unorderedNestedList","text":"- <b><code>$20400 × (0.0325 / 365 / 24) ≈ $0.075697 </code></b>","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"<b><code>$20400 × (0.0325 / 365 / 24) ≈ $0.075697 </code></b>","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"type":"subheading","text":"<b>​Eligible Events:</b>","idAttribute":"h_e447021f77"},{"type":"unorderedNestedList","text":"-  <a href=\"https://polymarket.com/event/presidential-election-winner-2028\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Presidential Election Winner 2028</a>\n-  <a href=\"https://polymarket.com/event/republican-presidential-nominee-2028\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Republican Presidential Nominee 2028</a>\n-  <a href=\"https://polymarket.com/event/democratic-presidential-nominee-2028\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Democratic Presidential Nominee 2028</a>\n-  <a href=\"https://polymarket.com/event/which-party-wins-2028-us-presidential-election\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Which party wins 2028 US Presidential Election?</a>\n-  <a href=\"https://polymarket.com/event/balance-of-power-2026-midterms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Balance of Power: 2026 Midterms</a>\n- <a href=\"https://polymarket.com/event/which-party-will-win-the-senate-in-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Which party will win the Senate in 2026?</a>\n- <a href=\"https://polymarket.com/event/which-party-will-win-the-house-in-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Which party will win the House in 2026?</a>\n- <a href=\"https://polymarket.com/event/erdoan-out-before-2027\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Erdoğan out before 2027?</a>\n- <a href=\"https://polymarket.com/event/zelenskyy-out-as-ukraine-president-before-2027\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Zelenskyy out as Ukraine president before 2027?</a>\n- <a href=\"https://polymarket.com/event/netanyahu-out-before-2027\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Netanyahu out before 2027?</a>\n- <a href=\"https://polymarket.com/event/xi-jinping-out-before-2027\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Xi Jinping out before 2027?</a>\n-  <a href=\"https://polymarket.com/event/putin-out-before-2027\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Putin out as President of Russia before 2027?</a>\n- <a href=\"https://polymarket.com/event/russia-x-ukraine-ceasefire-before-2027\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Russia x Ukraine ceasefire before 2027?</a>\n- <a href=\"https://polymarket.com/event/what-price-will-bitcoin-hit-before-2027\" target=\"_blan